		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  mot de passe et restauration d'une base de PostgreSQL 11 vers 13]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=31867#p31867"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>du changement à venir également coté method j&#039;imagine ?</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code># TYPE  DATABASE        USER            ADDRESS                 METHOD

# &quot;local&quot; is for Unix domain socket connections only
local   all             all                                     scram-sha-256
# IPv4 local connections:
host    all             all             127.0.0.1/32            scram-sha-256
# IPv6 local connections:
host    all             all             ::1/128                 scram-sha-256
# Allow replication connections from localhost, by a user with the
# replication privilege.
local   replication     all                                     scram-sha-256
host    replication     all             127.0.0.1/32            scram-sha-256
host    replication     all             ::1/128                 scram-sha-256</code></pre></div>]]></content>
